    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst Wsparcie \u003e Sprzęt",
    "content": "Wprowadzenie Ten artykuł pomocy opisuje, jak skonfigurować Full Swing Golf ze Swing Catalyst.\nWymagania Symulator Full Swing Golf z E6\nSwing Catalyst w wersji 4.5 lub nowszej, najlepiej 7.1 lub nowszej.\nInstalacja Upewnij się, że E6 jest zainstalowany i skonfigurowany przez przedstawiciela wsparcia Full Swing Golf.\nOtwórz Swing Catalyst i wybierz Full Swing Golf w Swing Catalyst Settings -\u003e Hardware.\nZamknij Swing Catalyst i przejdź do C:\\ProgramData\\Swing Catalyst\\settings\nOpen HardwareSettings.xml and navigate to where it says Enter the IP address of the network interface that has internet connectivity (or is directly connected to the Swing Catalyst computer). Make sure this is not the network adapter used for the DSP.\nAlternatively, if using E6 on the same machine as Swing Catalyst use the IP: 127.0.0.1\nWith E6 closed, open defaults.stg in Notepad, located at C:\\TruGolf\\ E6 Golf 1.6\\defaults.stg and change \u003cTrueAccessSettings Enabled=“False” to Enable=“True” as per screenshot below. Start up Full Swing Golf E6 and then start Swing Catalyst, make sure Use as trigger is selected and the Enabled checkbox is checked.\nTroubleshooting Full Swing Golf is not showing as connected Make sure E6 is running on the Full Swing computer.\nCheck network connectivity, can you ping the Full Swing computer from the Swing Catalyst computer?\nMake sure defaults.stg file’s TruAccessSettings is enabled.\nHave additional network cards or interfaces? Try disabling them. E6 is picky on what interface it chooses on startup and if it chooses the wrong interface or NIC the connection won’t work.\nTest integration with E6 Shot Data Test.bat \u0026 E6 shunt shot, press Ctrl S in practice mode (contact Full Swing Support) for further help here.\nRestart E6 (start E6 first then SC).\nRestart the computer(s).\nIf you tried all these steps and it still shows as not connected in Swing Catalyst, please contact support@swingcatalyst.com.\nLast updated: 2021-06-16 | View on official support site",
