    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst Wsparcie \u003e Konto i Ustawienia",
    "content": "Jak przywrócić starszą wersję oprogramowania Ten artykuł pomocy opisuje, jak zainstalować poprzednią wersję oprogramowania Swing Catalyst.\nJeśli jesteś użytkownikiem beta i chcesz zainstalować poprzednią stabilną wersję:\nOdznacz opcję “zezwalaj na wersje beta” po zainstalowaniu poprzedniej wersji. When rolling back to an older software version, Swing Catalyst will automatically attempt to find and load a matching database version. With every major release, e.g. 9.8 -\u003e 10.0, 10.0 -\u003e 10.1 there is a change in the database version. This means any recordings made with the newer version won’t be available in the old version. If you have important recordings you wish to save or make a back up of we strongly recommend exporting these before rolling back the software.\nTherefor it’s important to take this into consideration when wanting to roll back the software version.\nHow to uninstall Swing Catalyst Go to Windows Settings. Right click on the Windows icon on the Task bar , and select Settings\nIn Settings, click on Apps, then scroll down to you see Swing Catalyst, or type Swing in the search bar.\nClick on Swing Catalyst then click Uninstall.\nClick Yes and follow the on screen instructions.\n1. 2. Installing a previous version Older versions of Swing Catalyst can be found in our software archive.\nhttps://www.swingcatalyst.com/downloads/archives (scroll down from the download section):\nClick on the version you wish to install to download the installer file.\nFiles you download are usually put in the Downloads folder\nDouble click the version you wish to install and follow the onscreen instructions.\nLast updated: 2023-12-15 | View on official support site",
